PRIMARY UPDATE FOCUS: CRYSTALS
	The update will introduce crystals into the mod, and multiple ways to use them. They will be just as important as plants, will
	cover much of the mid-game content, and pave the way into end-game. While plants represent change and growth, crystals represent
	fortification and strength.

